## 10. Important Security Note

Never upload private credentials to GitHub.

Do NOT commit:

- OpenRouter API keys
- Firebase private keys
- Passwords
- Access tokens
- Service account credentials
- Private certificates

If an API key is accidentally uploaded to GitHub, revoke/rotate the key immediately.


## 11. Quick Start

For a fresh setup, run:

git clone https://github.com/not-vishnu/MediAlert.git

cd MediAlert

flutter pub get

flutterfire configure

flutter run --dart-define=OPENROUTER_API_KEY=YOUR_API_KEY


